---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="The A Rap Blog privacy policy.">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Collect less. Explain it clearly.</h1>
      <p>Last updated July 28, 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="shell legal-copy">
      <h2>Website analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site may use Netlify’s server-side analytics and Umami to understand aggregate traffic,
        referring sources, campaign links, and interactions such as newsletter or support-button
        clicks. Analytics event properties must not contain names, email addresses, or message
        content.
      </p>
      <h2>Email subscriptions</h2>
      <p>
        When the newsletter opens, Kit will process the email address and subscription status needed
        to deliver it. Subscriptions use confirmation, and every issue provides an unsubscribe
        mechanism. Kit’s own privacy terms apply to its processing.
      </p>
      <h2>Contributions and purchases</h2>
      <p>
        Buy Me a Coffee, its payment providers, and affiliate merchants process their own payment
        and transaction data. A Rap Blog does not receive or store full payment-card details.
      </p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        External sites have their own privacy practices. A link does not transfer this site’s
        privacy commitments to the destination.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact and changes</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions can be sent through the address on the <a href="/about">about page</a>.
        Material changes will update the date at the top of this page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
